- no jump button lands on the answer;
- QA presses each control once in DOM order, so every milestone needs a one-press path;
- tap targets are 44 px (`.tap`).

Re-run each brief's answer in node. If a brief is wrong, say so in the spec. Report in under 120 words: the specs written, and any brief problem.

